.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "BSDSF24M059-OS-A01" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B int mystrlen(const char* s);

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrlen
calculates and returns the number of characters in the string pointed to by
.I s
, excluding the terminating null character.

